# BenchMARL Experiment() writes <save_folder>/<run_name>/config.pkl at
# construction; tests and ad-hoc runs from src/ land here.
src/normalizedmappo_static_*/
normalizedmappo_static_*/

# --- committed archives, exempted from the *_out/ rule above ---
# `om2g_out/` and `*_out/` exist to keep live run output out of the repo. Three
# directories in this branch are deliverables that happen to match those
# patterns, and these negations keep them visible to `git status` and `git add -A`.
!arch_out/
!results/ladder-20260909/om2g_out/
